WEBVTT

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.920
Dad, how much further is it?

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:24.800
We're almost there.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.790
You keep saying that.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:29.430
I mean it this time.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.720
You've said that a lot, too.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.310
That's...

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.650
Do you remember?

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.030
No, not really.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.280
Well, you were just a little girl back then.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.570
It's understandable.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:51.190
Has the town changed a lot since then?

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.620
I'd say it has.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.260
It's like a dream.

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.410
Nonoka!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.270
Wait!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.990
Okay, I get it! Be quiet already!

00:03:33.990 --> 00:03:35.280
Where are you?

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.530
Where are you hiding?

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.620
I should have taken out the battery...

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.120
Um...

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.580
Found it!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.920
Hey, these are Dad's things!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:03:59.970
Nonoka...

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.020
Seven years, huh?

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.740
Good morning, Dad.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.650
Morning.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.320
Did you sleep well?

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.230
Not really.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.330
I think I dozed off while I was unpacking.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.790
Well, it was a long trip.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:24.960
Of course you'd be tired.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.330
You haven't had breakfast yet, have you?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.580
I'll cook something for you!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.090
We should have gone shopping yesterday...

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.330
Yup, this should do.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.430
Dad!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.230
Huh?

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.690
I was asking about our plans for today.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.070
Uh...

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:58.490
Come on!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.340
It's caught on the door, Koharu.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.840
Oh, welcome!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.390
You've got one too many arms.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.090
Also, I'm not a customer.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.230
That's a shame.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.940
Don't you guys have
anyone else working here?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:36.270
Well, I'm the sign girl,
so it's kinda my responsibility.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:41.780
The sign girl doesn't actually have
anything to do with the signs, you know.

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:44.030
Did you say something?

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:47.870
Let me do it.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.630
Thank you, Souta.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:05.890
How are these "Disc Buns" any different from
the hot spring buns we used to eat as kids?

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.390
Maybe... its appearance?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.440
You know,

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.650
that thing's giving you a lot
more trouble than it's worth.

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:17.820
That's not true.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.400
It helps attract a lot of customers,

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.650
and I love chatting with them.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.120
You should be out enjoying your summer vacation or something.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.290
I've been helping out
at the store since I was little.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.760
Things have definitely
changed since then, though.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.390
Dad,

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.090
I'll be done with the dishes soon,

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.650
so how about we clean
the house together after—

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.020
Sorry!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.230
What? Now?!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.150
I'm sorry.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.070
It looks like they want me to fill in today.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.160
Don't worry, I'll be back in the evening.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.490
But what about the cleaning?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.750
And the shopping?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.250
Please, and thank you.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.750
I'm not going to do it all by myself!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.420
I won't do it, you hear me?!

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:29.600
Next is...

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:46.690
Nonoka!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.450
Nonoka!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.040
Hey, hang on!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.330
Wait!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.410
Who are you?

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:03.330
I'm Noel...

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.630
Noel?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.430
You're coming with me!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.620
This'll last me a while.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.210
Hold the bus!

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:49.430
Hey! Mr. Driver!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.600
I said wait!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:52.930
Hey!

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.270
What's the matter with you?!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.450
What'd I do to deserve this?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.200
Your name's Noel?

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:17.580
Yup!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.960
There's a lot I want to ask you...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.710
And Noel has a lot to talk about with you!

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:29.710
Um, why were you in my room?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.470
Because I wanted to see you!

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:36.390
I got bored of waiting over there for so long!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.270
"There?"

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:40.730
The place where Noel met Nonoka!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.890
I'm not sure I know what you're talking about...

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:50.660
B-But, I'm getting the feeling I know you from somewhere.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:53.740
I wonder why.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.410
That's because we were together!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.000
Together?

00:09:59.000 --> 00:09:59.710
Yup.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.040
A long time ago.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.250
A long time ago...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.500
Nonoka?

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:08.760
Are you hungry?

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.550
I was about to go out
and buy some things.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:13.510
Noel will come with you, Nonoka!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.510
I'll be back soon, so just wait here.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:18.810
Okay.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.400
<i>I'll wait!</i>

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:33.820
I wonder why...

00:10:52.090 --> 00:10:55.680
Is Nonoka too busy to talk to me right now?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>Wait here, okay? I'll be right back!</i>

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:22.120
<i>I'll be waiting!</i>

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.130
Why did you come back
here after all this time?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:33.800
Eh?

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:38.600
Huh?

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.180
Um—

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.730
You mean me?

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.070
Ta-da!

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.790
Noel will do her best!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.500
Let's do it.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:45.790
That scared me.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.580
See? Nothing happened.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:56.040
That was really fun,
but it made me feel a little nervous.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:01.930
Wait!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.770
You're not going home?

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.310
Can we try one more time?

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:10.190
It's getting late, and we should get back
before the snow gets too heavy.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.940
We'll do it next time, okay?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.200
Let's go home.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.160
Um, I'm...

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.330
What's wrong?

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:33.330
Next time, for sure!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.090
All right.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:43.840
I'm...

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:46.930
moving away though.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:58.990
Huh?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.320
I'm home.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.370
Did she already leave?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.450
What happened here?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.670
Noel?

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:24.800
Nonoka!

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:28.550
Noel!

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.140
Welcome back, Nonoka!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.810
Why'd you go and do that?!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.100
"That?"

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.480
I thought you'd be happy if I did!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.230
Get out!

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:43.990
But what about dinner?

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.200
I don't know who you are,

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:49.580
but I don't want to see you ever again!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:25.530
Noel...

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.280
That doesn't make it...

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.300
I'm home.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.010
Welcome home.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.350
I'm really sorry about today.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:51.930
I shouldn't have just left like that.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:52.680
Dad,

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.350
Hm? What is it?

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.890
Um, I'm really sorry.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.150
I wasn't being careful enough, and—

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.350
Oh, you found it, huh?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.650
When I was packing back in Tokyo, I accidentally...

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.360
Huh?

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.860
I was hoping to change it before you noticed,

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.320
so I bought a new one on
the way home from work today.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:11.110
Noel!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:12.700
Here!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.660
Hey, what's gotten into you?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.660
I'm going out!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.370
It'll be dark soon!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.500
I have to apologize!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.090
I have to properly apologize to Noel!

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:06.050
Noel!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:12.930
Excuse me!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.720
Welcome!

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.850
Sorry, but I'm not a customer.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.190
I'm looking for someone.

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.060
She's a little girl.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.480
Is she lost?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.280
No, it's nothing like that.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.150
Have you seen a girl called Noel?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.570
She dresses a little different.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.740
Is she from overseas?

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.120
I can't find her...

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>I don't want to see you ever again!</i>

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.470
Why did I say something like that?

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:13.780
The observatory!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.000
You're so good at that, Nonoka!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:25.250
Mom is even better than me!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:28.750
She was the one who taught me, after all.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.510
She's more amazing than you, Nonoka?

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:31.340
Yup!

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:36.430
Noel wants to hear your Mom sing too!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:43.480
The three of us are leaving today.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.350
We're moving to Tokyo.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.770
Are you going far away?

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.570
Oh, I know!

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.530
I'll bring Mom here!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.780
I bet once I tell her about you,
she'll be happy to come here!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.200
Really?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:01.660
Wait here, okay?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.370
I'll be right back.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.670
Okay! I'll be waiting!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:12.170
Nonoka!

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:13.920
Where on earth have you been?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.130
We have to get going now.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.510
Eh?

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:17.140
What is it?

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.560
Um, Noel's waiting for me.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:22.470
Also, I haven't said goodbye to everyone yet.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.390
We have to get to the ferry on time!

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.980
Let's not make things harder on Mom, okay?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.770
Will we be back in this town soon?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.400
Yes, of course.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.030
We'll all come back together.

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.620
<i>Noel, I'm...</i>

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.040
Um...

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.960
I always knew...

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.800
I always knew that you'd come back.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.220
I'm so sorry!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.220
I...

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:27.220
Noel!

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:30.770
I'm so sorry!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.150
Welcome back, Nonoka.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:36.900
I'm back.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:39.530
I'm back, Noel.

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:46.570
This time...

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:50.410
This time, it's Noel's turn to keep her promise!

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:51.990
Promise?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:52.960
Yup.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:55.000
That's what Noel's here for.

00:21:57.300 --> 00:22:00.090
To make your wish come true.

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.850
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:36.230
"The Pair's Promise."

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:37.480
Look forward to it!
